<title>SWITZERLAND: BMW sees slight growth in 1997.</title>
<headline>BMW sees slight growth in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German carmaker BMW chairman Bernd Pischetsrieder said on Wednesday he expected single digit profit growth in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;There will certainly be slight growth,&quot;  Pischetsrieder told Reuters ahead of a speech he was due to give in Zurich.</p>
<p>Asked what he meant by slight, Pischetsrieder said single digit.</p>
</text>
